  "releaseNotes": "Preview 15 fixes encrypted-field updates and migrations, concrete reads, string-range ordering, checkpoint publication, delete-policy enforcement, password admission and JWT refresh cancellation. Durability, committed-copy reads and existing storage formats are preserved. Adds server-owned remote revisions, explicit import authorization and staged context-bound field encryption. Coordinated client/server upgrade required. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/ToolMaker/InterfaceDB/blob/v1.0.0-preview.15/documentation/preview15-release-notes.md",
